The Andhra Pradesh Aquaculture Seed (Quality Control) Act, 2006
aqua-culture seeds are placed;
(11)
"Export" means taking Aqua-culture seed from India and Andhra Pradesh State to a place outside India and Andhra
Pradesh State;
(12)
"Fisherman" means a person who is involved in capture fishery activity by occupation and also includes fishermen by
birth;
(13)
"Fish Seed Farm" means a place with structures for rearing of early stages of fish seed such as spawn or hatchlings to
the stages of fry or fingerlings or advanced fingerlings;
(14)
"Government" means the State Government of Andhra Pradesh;

